Select the three paragraphs of the body. Open *Home* > *Paragraph* (the small arrow at the bottom right of the group) and in the *Indents and Spacing* tab set:

- *Line spacing*: **1.5 lines**;
- *Spacing Before*: **0 pt**;
- *Spacing After*: **12 pt**.

Click *OK*.

*Marking idea (3 marks):* line spacing 1.5 (1); before 0 (1); after 12 pt (1).
